# | Moxa ioLogik E2214 Ethernet Remote I/O — 6-channel DO Relay + 6-channel DI
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DO Relay bit ctrl ch0-5 (0x0000-0x001F), DI counter ctrl (0x0020-0x0057)
# | FC02 (1xxxx R): DI bit value ch0-5 (0x0000-0x0005)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): DI count value u32 hi+lo ch0-5 (0x0000-0x000B)
# | FC03 (4xxxx R/W): primary register space below
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2214
@vendor_website=moxa.com
@description=6-DO Relay + 6-DI Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-5 (0-11), DO_pulseLowWidth ch0-5 (12-17), DO_pulseHighWidth ch0-5 (18-23), DO_mode ch0-5 (24-29, 0=DO 1=Pulse), DI_countFilter ch0-5 (30-35), DI_mode ch0-5 (36-41, 0=DI 1=Count), DO_value Citect ch0-5 (0x002A-0x002F 0=Off 1=On 2=HoldLast), DO_powerOnValue (0x0030-0x0035), DO_safeModeValue (0x0036-0x003B), DI_counterTrigger ch0-5 (0x0060-0x0065, 0=L2H 1=H2L), DO_relayCurrentCount u32 hi+lo ch0-5 (0x0078-0x0083), DO_powerOnSequenceDelay ch0-5 (0x0084-0x0089, max 300s), IntReg00-23 initial (0x0178-0x018F) working (0x0B68-0x0B7F), DI_counterModeValue ch0-5 (0x0D00-0x0D05). FC04: DI_countValue u32 hi+lo ch0-5 (0x0000-0x000B). FC01: DO Relay bit ctrl (0-31), DI counter ctrl (32-87). FC02: DI_bitValue ch0-5 (0-5).
